1
00:00:01,041 --> 00:00:02,958
[monsters snarling]

2
00:00:05,416 --> 00:00:06,875
[people screaming in panic]

3
00:00:06,875 --> 00:00:09,000
[Beatrix] At last, my city...

4
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:10,583
my kingdom...

5
00:00:10,583 --> 00:00:14,541
your Empress has returned!

6
00:00:14,541 --> 00:00:16,125
[people screaming in panic]

7
00:00:22,833 --> 00:00:25,625
[Nya]
It's too dangerous out here!

8
00:00:25,625 --> 00:00:27,541
You all have to get to safety!

9
00:00:27,541 --> 00:00:28,791
Thank you, Ninja!

10
00:00:28,791 --> 00:00:31,458
Beatrix coming back
is our worst nightmare.

11
00:00:31,458 --> 00:00:32,541
[Nya] H'yah! Ugh!

12
00:00:32,541 --> 00:00:33,833
[Sora] H'yah!

13
00:00:33,833 --> 00:00:36,291
Who could support her
after everything she did?

14
00:00:36,291 --> 00:00:37,625
Bunch of weirdos.

15
00:00:37,625 --> 00:00:38,666
[monsters snarling]

16
00:00:41,333 --> 00:00:42,708
[Sora] Please work, powers.

17
00:00:42,708 --> 00:00:43,916
Please work!

18
00:00:43,916 --> 00:00:44,958
[Nya] H'yah!

19
00:00:44,958 --> 00:00:46,166
[Sora] Ugh!

20
00:00:46,166 --> 00:00:48,416
So much for trying that move
on Beatrix again.

21
00:00:49,500 --> 00:00:51,833
For a free Imperium!

22
00:00:51,833 --> 00:00:54,208
[Beatrix] Ah,
just who I was looking for.

23
00:00:55,041 --> 00:00:58,125
How dare you seize power
in my absence?

24
00:00:58,125 --> 00:00:58,958
[he struggles]

25
00:00:58,958 --> 00:01:01,166
I didn't seize power.

26
00:01:01,166 --> 00:01:02,625
I was elected.

27
00:01:02,625 --> 00:01:04,166
I serve my people.

28
00:01:04,166 --> 00:01:06,125
[Beatrix] You naïve child.

29
00:01:06,125 --> 00:01:07,791
A leader doesn't serve.

30
00:01:07,791 --> 00:01:09,666
A leader <i>is </i>served,

31
00:01:09,666 --> 00:01:12,333
and you will watch helplessly

32
00:01:12,333 --> 00:01:15,166
as I take back
my rightful throne.

33
00:01:15,166 --> 00:01:16,000
No!

34
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:17,375
We'll be free,

35
00:01:17,375 --> 00:01:18,708
or perish!

36
00:01:18,708 --> 00:01:19,750
[Beatrix] Okay, then.

37
00:01:19,750 --> 00:01:21,041
[screaming]

38
00:01:21,041 --> 00:01:22,250
[Beatrix] You will all submit

39
00:01:22,250 --> 00:01:24,458
to your Good Empress,

40
00:01:24,458 --> 00:01:25,500
or be crushed!

41
00:01:25,500 --> 00:01:27,041
[monsters snarling]

42
00:01:27,041 --> 00:01:28,416
[Nya] Ugh! Ah!

43
00:01:28,416 --> 00:01:29,541
[Sora] Aah!

44
00:01:29,541 --> 00:01:30,875
[groaning in pain]

45
00:01:30,875 --> 00:01:33,416
[♪♪♪]

46
00:01:37,041 --> 00:01:39,125
Is that... Lloyd?

47
00:01:39,125 --> 00:01:42,458
Stop using
the Weapon of Desolation!

48
00:01:44,041 --> 00:01:45,333
[roaring]

49
00:01:50,375 --> 00:01:51,541
[roaring]

50
00:01:51,541 --> 00:01:53,208
[Lloyd]
You're playing with forces

51
00:01:53,208 --> 00:01:54,833
you cannot understand.

52
00:01:54,833 --> 00:01:58,666
Oh, I understand force
very well, Green Ninja.

53
00:01:58,666 --> 00:02:00,375
What I don't understand

54
00:02:00,375 --> 00:02:03,000
is this hideous
new dragon shape.

55
00:02:03,000 --> 00:02:06,291
Oh, I didn't think you Ninja
could sicken me more.

56
00:02:06,291 --> 00:02:08,500
[Lloyd]
Then you underestimate us.

57
00:02:08,500 --> 00:02:10,833
Looks like
you've changed too, Beatrix,

58
00:02:10,833 --> 00:02:12,208
for the worse.

59
00:02:12,208 --> 00:02:13,708
Much worse.

60
00:02:13,708 --> 00:02:17,708
That's "Empress Beatrix,"

61
00:02:17,708 --> 00:02:20,583
and I am
what you forced me to become!

62
00:02:20,583 --> 00:02:22,791
I survived the living nightmare

63
00:02:22,791 --> 00:02:24,708
that is the Land of Monsters,

64
00:02:24,708 --> 00:02:27,708
and no ninja, in any form,

65
00:02:27,708 --> 00:02:30,583
will stop me now!

66
00:02:30,583 --> 00:02:31,708
[Lloyd] H'yah!

67
00:02:31,708 --> 00:02:32,625
[roaring]

68
00:02:32,625 --> 00:02:34,708
♪ Lost in the unknown ♪

69
00:02:34,708 --> 00:02:35,916
♪ So much to see ♪

70
00:02:35,916 --> 00:02:39,000
♪ Jump up, kick back
whip around and spin ♪

71
00:02:39,000 --> 00:02:40,500
♪ Together we will rise ♪

72
00:02:40,500 --> 00:02:42,208
♪ Whip around and spin ♪

73
00:02:42,208 --> 00:02:43,750
♪ Together we will rise ♪

74
00:02:43,750 --> 00:02:45,375
♪ For what's right ♪

75
00:02:47,750 --> 00:02:50,041
[Cole grunts with effort]

76
00:02:50,041 --> 00:02:51,791
[powers sparking]

77
00:02:51,791 --> 00:02:52,958
[monsters roaring]

78
00:02:54,125 --> 00:02:55,750
Aah!

79
00:02:55,750 --> 00:02:56,708
I don't need saving!

80
00:02:56,708 --> 00:02:59,041
[Kai] We all need saving
right now.

81
00:02:59,041 --> 00:03:00,000
[snarling]

82
00:03:00,000 --> 00:03:01,583
[Frak] H'yah!

83
00:03:03,375 --> 00:03:04,500
Ugh!

84
00:03:04,500 --> 00:03:05,791
[groaning]

85
00:03:06,916 --> 00:03:08,708
H'uh!

86
00:03:08,708 --> 00:03:09,875
[Riyu grumbles]

87
00:03:12,916 --> 00:03:13,833
[snarling]

88
00:03:17,541 --> 00:03:18,916
[Jay] Uh!

89
00:03:19,875 --> 00:03:21,375
[Jay] Eat lightning!

90
00:03:21,375 --> 00:03:23,250
-[powers sparking]
-[Jay] Hey!

91
00:03:23,250 --> 00:03:25,208
What? Stop staring!

92
00:03:25,208 --> 00:03:26,375
Aah!

93
00:03:26,375 --> 00:03:28,875
I already feel insecure
about this as it is.

94
00:03:28,875 --> 00:03:30,083
[roaring]

95
00:03:31,750 --> 00:03:33,333
[Beatrix] That impact
would have crushed

96
00:03:33,333 --> 00:03:34,791
any other mortal.

97
00:03:34,791 --> 00:03:36,833
Your new form is repulsive,

98
00:03:36,833 --> 00:03:38,416
but it is tough.

99
00:03:38,416 --> 00:03:40,416
It still won't be
enough, though.

100
00:03:40,416 --> 00:03:43,208
[Lloyd] I've changed much more
than my appearance.

101
00:03:43,208 --> 00:03:45,958
I now understand my role
in this world,

102
00:03:45,958 --> 00:03:49,041
my connections to everything
in the Merged La--

103
00:03:49,041 --> 00:03:50,541
Ugh! Are you trying
to make me puke

104
00:03:50,541 --> 00:03:52,375
with this spiritual garbage?

105
00:03:52,375 --> 00:03:53,916
Just shut up and fight!

106
00:03:53,916 --> 00:03:55,916
H'yah!

107
00:03:55,916 --> 00:03:58,750
I don't care
about your connections.

108
00:03:58,750 --> 00:04:01,250
I care about your destruction!

109
00:04:01,250 --> 00:04:04,041
Yours and everyone
who opposes me!

110
00:04:04,041 --> 00:04:06,125
H'yah! Ugh! Ah!

111
00:04:06,958 --> 00:04:08,083
Raah!

112
00:04:09,791 --> 00:04:12,416
[Lloyd] You will care
about my connections

113
00:04:12,416 --> 00:04:14,625
when I defeat you with them!

114
00:04:14,625 --> 00:04:16,083
H'yah!

115
00:04:17,250 --> 00:04:18,375
[roaring]

116
00:04:18,375 --> 00:04:19,250
[Nya gasping]

117
00:04:19,250 --> 00:04:21,583
Wait... does this mean--?

118
00:04:23,125 --> 00:04:24,666
Whoo-hoo!

119
00:04:27,875 --> 00:04:28,875
Yaah!

120
00:04:31,250 --> 00:04:32,416
[Jay] Yee-ha!

121
00:04:33,375 --> 00:04:34,250
[Cole grunting with effort]

122
00:04:35,541 --> 00:04:38,041
[Cole] Sorry,
time to end this dance!

123
00:04:41,833 --> 00:04:44,083
[Frak]
Did you see that green light?

124
00:04:44,083 --> 00:04:46,541
[Kai] That was way more
than light.

125
00:04:46,541 --> 00:04:47,791
[Wyldfyre laughs]

126
00:04:47,791 --> 00:04:51,000
Stop talking
and start blasting, Kai!

127
00:04:51,000 --> 00:04:52,541
Whoo-hoo!

128
00:04:52,541 --> 00:04:53,791
[Frak] Yeah,
but how did our powers--

129
00:04:53,791 --> 00:04:54,833
[Wyldfyre] What did I just say?

130
00:04:55,833 --> 00:04:57,791
-R'ah! H'yah!
-[Kai] I really missed her.

131
00:04:57,791 --> 00:04:59,625
Fire!

132
00:04:59,625 --> 00:05:01,625
[♪♪♪]

133
00:05:01,625 --> 00:05:04,000
[Frak]
And I really missed this!

134
00:05:04,000 --> 00:05:05,583
[thumping]

135
00:05:05,583 --> 00:05:08,583
[Riyu groans]

136
00:05:11,791 --> 00:05:12,916
[Riyu growl-talking]

137
00:05:12,916 --> 00:05:14,791
[Cole chuckles]
You're welcome, buddy.

138
00:05:25,750 --> 00:05:27,958
[Beatrix] Of course you Ninja
would try and steal

139
00:05:27,958 --> 00:05:29,916
what is rightfully mine!

140
00:05:29,916 --> 00:05:32,416
[Lloyd] You don't know
how dangerous that thing is!

141
00:05:32,416 --> 00:05:33,833
What it can do!

142
00:05:33,833 --> 00:05:36,833
[Beatrix] It's pretty clear
that I do know what it can do.

143
00:05:36,833 --> 00:05:40,041
You're manipulating
unbalanced Source Energy.

144
00:05:40,041 --> 00:05:41,833
It's incredibly dangerous!

145
00:05:41,833 --> 00:05:42,958
[Beatrix] Indeed.

146
00:05:42,958 --> 00:05:45,958
Dangerous to all who oppose me!

147
00:05:45,958 --> 00:05:47,458
[Lloyd] H'yah!

148
00:05:48,541 --> 00:05:50,750
[monsters snarling]

149
00:06:00,541 --> 00:06:02,583
[Beatrix] Destroy him!

150
00:06:05,458 --> 00:06:06,916
[monsters roaring]

151
00:06:06,916 --> 00:06:07,916
[Sora] Come on!

152
00:06:07,916 --> 00:06:09,583
We've gotta get you indoors!

153
00:06:10,791 --> 00:06:11,791
Hi'yah!

154
00:06:13,291 --> 00:06:15,916
[citizens screaming]

155
00:06:19,333 --> 00:06:20,916
[snarling]

156
00:06:20,916 --> 00:06:22,166
[Nya] All clear!

157
00:06:22,166 --> 00:06:23,625
Go!

158
00:06:23,625 --> 00:06:24,708
Yaah!

159
00:06:26,666 --> 00:06:27,666
[Sora] How...?

160
00:06:27,666 --> 00:06:28,791
[Nya] My powers came back!

161
00:06:28,791 --> 00:06:30,875
[Sora] Hyah! Funny. Mine...

162
00:06:32,583 --> 00:06:34,500
...are totally
working again too!

163
00:06:42,125 --> 00:06:43,583
[Nya] Must be from
that green wave of power

164
00:06:43,583 --> 00:06:45,041
Lloyd sent out.

165
00:06:46,291 --> 00:06:48,083
[Sora] Lloyd comes back
looking like a dragon,

166
00:06:48,083 --> 00:06:49,500
and makes our powers work?

167
00:06:49,500 --> 00:06:52,041
He has a lot
of explaining to do.

168
00:06:54,625 --> 00:06:56,291
[Sora] Come on!

169
00:06:56,291 --> 00:06:57,625
[Lloyd] Yaah! Yaah!

170
00:06:57,625 --> 00:06:59,583
[monster snarling]

171
00:07:00,583 --> 00:07:01,666
[Lloyd] Yaah!

172
00:07:03,083 --> 00:07:05,083
[grunting]

173
00:07:08,666 --> 00:07:09,666
Raah!

174
00:07:10,666 --> 00:07:11,666
[Nya] Hi-yah!

175
00:07:12,583 --> 00:07:14,666
Yaah! Unh!

176
00:07:16,458 --> 00:07:19,041
[energy ringing]

177
00:07:20,041 --> 00:07:22,125
[Nya] H'yah! What's going on?

178
00:07:22,125 --> 00:07:23,750
Your powers get all weird again?

179
00:07:23,750 --> 00:07:24,750
[Sora] I don't think so.

180
00:07:24,750 --> 00:07:25,666
I think her mech,

181
00:07:25,666 --> 00:07:28,125
whatever she did to herself,

182
00:07:28,125 --> 00:07:30,375
it's not technology anymore.

183
00:07:30,375 --> 00:07:33,666
It's part of her, organic.

184
00:07:33,666 --> 00:07:35,708
[Nya] Gross. H'yah!

185
00:07:35,708 --> 00:07:36,666
Any other brilliant ideas--
-[blow landing]

186
00:07:36,666 --> 00:07:37,750
[groaning]

187
00:07:41,125 --> 00:07:42,000
[impact]

188
00:07:43,958 --> 00:07:45,416
[Arin] Oh, uh, hi.

189
00:07:45,416 --> 00:07:46,875
Looked like you were in trouble?

190
00:07:46,875 --> 00:07:48,125
[Sora] Arin!

191
00:07:48,125 --> 00:07:51,000
Oh, I was starting to worry
I'd never see you again! Oh!

192
00:07:51,000 --> 00:07:52,291
[Nya] Where did you come from?

193
00:07:52,291 --> 00:07:53,291
[monsters snarling]

194
00:07:55,083 --> 00:07:56,833
[weapon firing]

195
00:07:56,833 --> 00:07:58,416
[Nya] Zane?

196
00:07:58,416 --> 00:08:00,541
[Sora] Euphrasia?

197
00:08:03,833 --> 00:08:05,166
[Arin] On the downlow,

198
00:08:05,166 --> 00:08:08,166
Zane's chopper is not as fast
as Lloyd's new wings.

199
00:08:09,458 --> 00:08:10,458
[monsters snarling]

200
00:08:10,458 --> 00:08:12,000
[citizens screaming]

201
00:08:13,000 --> 00:08:13,833
[Lloyd grunts]

202
00:08:13,833 --> 00:08:15,916
H'ah! H'yah! Y'ah!

203
00:08:18,541 --> 00:08:19,708
[claws ringing]

204
00:08:20,708 --> 00:08:21,625
[roaring]

205
00:08:24,625 --> 00:08:25,625
H'yah!

206
00:08:27,166 --> 00:08:28,541
Impossible!

207
00:08:29,833 --> 00:08:30,750
[Lloyd] Yaah!

208
00:08:30,750 --> 00:08:33,625
[claws slicing]

209
00:08:36,416 --> 00:08:37,458
[Frak grunts]

210
00:08:37,458 --> 00:08:39,541
Don't think
you were invited there!

211
00:08:41,500 --> 00:08:42,875
H'yah!

212
00:08:47,833 --> 00:08:49,458
[Cole grunts with effort]

213
00:08:51,916 --> 00:08:54,083
[Cole] Hopefully that'll
keep 'em out for a while.

214
00:08:54,083 --> 00:08:56,458
[Jay] Look!
Is that... Lloyd?

215
00:08:58,125 --> 00:08:59,000
[Lloyd] Yaah!

216
00:09:04,166 --> 00:09:07,375
[Beatrix] Your new powers
have some surprises?

217
00:09:07,375 --> 00:09:10,250
Well... so do mine!

218
00:09:10,250 --> 00:09:12,208
[rumbling]

219
00:09:12,208 --> 00:09:13,750
[Sora] H'yah!

220
00:09:13,750 --> 00:09:14,791
[Arin gasps]

221
00:09:14,791 --> 00:09:15,958
[Nya] H'yah!

222
00:09:15,958 --> 00:09:17,000
[gasping]

223
00:09:17,000 --> 00:09:18,291
[Cole] That can't be good.

224
00:09:18,291 --> 00:09:20,875
[Beatrix]
I will take back my kingdom,

225
00:09:20,875 --> 00:09:24,541
or I will see it in ruins!

226
00:09:27,958 --> 00:09:30,500
[monster bellowing]

227
00:09:30,500 --> 00:09:34,000
[laughing maniacally]

228
00:09:39,458 --> 00:09:40,958
[gasping]

229
00:09:42,958 --> 00:09:44,708
[monster bellowing]

230
00:09:44,708 --> 00:09:46,666
[Loyalist] I did not know
the Weapon of Desolation

231
00:09:46,666 --> 00:09:47,625
held such power!

232
00:09:47,625 --> 00:09:48,666
[bellowing]

233
00:09:48,666 --> 00:09:49,916
[Lloyd gasps]

234
00:09:49,916 --> 00:09:51,166
Nor I.

235
00:09:51,166 --> 00:09:54,125
I wonder if Beatrix is indeed
still controlling it.

236
00:09:54,125 --> 00:09:55,333
[Loyalist] I am certain

237
00:09:55,333 --> 00:09:57,750
this was all part
of the Good Empress's plans.

238
00:10:00,750 --> 00:10:02,250
[Lloyd roars]

239
00:10:02,250 --> 00:10:03,541
[monster bellowing]

240
00:10:05,791 --> 00:10:07,041
[Lloyd] Yaah!

241
00:10:07,041 --> 00:10:08,291
[Kai] Lloyd!

242
00:10:09,500 --> 00:10:10,541
[Kai] H'yah!

243
00:10:10,541 --> 00:10:12,625
[Wyldfyre] H'yah!

244
00:10:13,875 --> 00:10:15,208
[roaring]

245
00:10:15,208 --> 00:10:17,166
[Jay] H'yah! Ah!

246
00:10:20,500 --> 00:10:23,166
[Arin] Oh, this looks bad.

247
00:10:23,166 --> 00:10:24,125
Really bad!

248
00:10:26,750 --> 00:10:28,583
H'yah!

249
00:10:29,708 --> 00:10:30,583
[blow landing]

250
00:10:32,833 --> 00:10:34,208
-[roaring]
-Aah!

251
00:10:35,000 --> 00:10:36,208
[Lloyd gasping]

252
00:10:36,208 --> 00:10:37,583
[Beatrix] This vision

253
00:10:37,583 --> 00:10:40,625
is what carried me
through the torment of my exile!

254
00:10:40,625 --> 00:10:42,000
Crush him!

255
00:10:42,000 --> 00:10:43,041
[Lloyd] Aah!

256
00:10:44,041 --> 00:10:45,041
[gasping]

257
00:10:47,041 --> 00:10:48,208
[heavy blow landing]

258
00:10:50,250 --> 00:10:51,583
[Nya] Yaah!

259
00:10:51,583 --> 00:10:53,166
[Zane] H'yah!

260
00:10:54,625 --> 00:10:56,583
[Nya] There he is! Let's go!

261
00:10:56,583 --> 00:10:58,541
[monster bellowing]

262
00:10:58,541 --> 00:11:00,583
[Zane] H'yah!

263
00:11:00,583 --> 00:11:01,666
[snarling]

264
00:11:01,666 --> 00:11:02,833
[Zane and Nya yelp]

265
00:11:05,291 --> 00:11:06,333
[grunting with effort]

266
00:11:08,625 --> 00:11:12,041
[monsters snarling]

267
00:11:12,041 --> 00:11:13,458
[cackling]

268
00:11:13,458 --> 00:11:14,500
[monster snarling]

269
00:11:16,250 --> 00:11:18,083
[Cole] Yaah! Yaah!

270
00:11:18,083 --> 00:11:18,916
Yaah!

271
00:11:21,500 --> 00:11:23,208
[Cole] Yaah!

272
00:11:23,208 --> 00:11:25,208
What's up, Lloyd? Been too long!

273
00:11:25,208 --> 00:11:26,541
Change your costume
or something?

274
00:11:26,541 --> 00:11:28,958
[Lloyd] Still hilarious, Cole.

275
00:11:28,958 --> 00:11:31,000
[roaring]

276
00:11:32,583 --> 00:11:35,416
A dragon dares show itself
in my presence?

277
00:11:35,416 --> 00:11:38,375
Rip that filthy beast to shreds!

278
00:11:39,666 --> 00:11:41,166
[Cole] Hup! H'yah!

279
00:11:43,416 --> 00:11:46,208
I should have destroyed you
when I had the chance, Ninja.

280
00:11:47,541 --> 00:11:50,041
[Cole] I was literally thinking
the exact same thing,

281
00:11:50,041 --> 00:11:51,916
but you wanted me
to watch your triumph.

282
00:11:51,916 --> 00:11:52,958
How's that workin' for ya?

283
00:11:52,958 --> 00:11:54,500
[monster snarling]

284
00:11:55,416 --> 00:11:57,541
I will not be defeated!

285
00:11:57,541 --> 00:11:58,541
[rumbling]

286
00:11:58,541 --> 00:12:00,166
[energy ringing]

287
00:12:01,416 --> 00:12:02,291
[bellowing]

288
00:12:03,416 --> 00:12:05,625
No... don't push it.

289
00:12:09,458 --> 00:12:11,083
[crumbling blast]

290
00:12:11,083 --> 00:12:12,625
[bellowing]

291
00:12:14,250 --> 00:12:15,916
[wheezing roar]

292
00:12:15,916 --> 00:12:16,916
[Arin] What's happening to them?

293
00:12:16,916 --> 00:12:18,041
[Sora] I-I don't know!

294
00:12:18,041 --> 00:12:19,708
[Nya gasps]

295
00:12:20,958 --> 00:12:23,208
[Zane] They took in
significant energy,

296
00:12:23,208 --> 00:12:25,458
yet did not grow larger.

297
00:12:25,458 --> 00:12:26,791
Aah!

298
00:12:26,791 --> 00:12:29,625
[Nya] But they did get
a lot stronger!

299
00:12:29,625 --> 00:12:30,708
[Sora] Aah!

300
00:12:30,708 --> 00:12:31,833
[Arin] Ugh!

301
00:12:31,833 --> 00:12:33,083
[bellowing]

302
00:12:36,625 --> 00:12:38,166
[roaring]

303
00:12:39,875 --> 00:12:40,916
[Lloyd] H'yah!

304
00:12:42,916 --> 00:12:44,458
H'ah!

305
00:12:44,458 --> 00:12:45,375
H'yah!

306
00:12:46,958 --> 00:12:48,375
[grunting in pain]

307
00:12:48,375 --> 00:12:49,541
[Beatrix cackles]

308
00:12:49,541 --> 00:12:51,916
You deserve this, Ninja!

309
00:12:54,500 --> 00:12:56,500
[Lloyd strains]

310
00:12:59,041 --> 00:13:03,083
<i>[Arc Dragon speaking]</i>
<i>Connection... Green Ninja.</i>

311
00:13:03,083 --> 00:13:07,625
<i>Do not forget your true power.</i>

312
00:13:07,625 --> 00:13:09,791
[♪♪♪]

313
00:13:13,250 --> 00:13:14,416
[roaring]

314
00:13:17,708 --> 00:13:20,708
[♪♪♪]

315
00:13:22,875 --> 00:13:23,875
H'uh!

316
00:13:23,875 --> 00:13:26,250
Haah!

317
00:13:26,250 --> 00:13:27,833
Aah!

318
00:13:31,958 --> 00:13:34,250
[♪♪♪]

319
00:13:34,250 --> 00:13:35,958
[Nya]
Well, this is certainly wild.

320
00:13:37,250 --> 00:13:39,750
Raah-ha!

321
00:13:39,750 --> 00:13:41,708
[Kai] Yaah! Hah!

322
00:13:41,708 --> 00:13:43,541
Kai became a dragon?

323
00:13:43,541 --> 00:13:45,916
Why didn't I become a dragon?!

324
00:13:46,833 --> 00:13:48,083
[♪♪♪]

325
00:13:48,083 --> 00:13:49,125
[monster bellowing]

326
00:13:49,125 --> 00:13:50,708
[Nya] Huh! H'yah!

327
00:13:54,500 --> 00:13:55,958
[Frak]
Let's be anywhere but here!

328
00:13:55,958 --> 00:13:57,041
[bellowing]

329
00:13:57,958 --> 00:13:58,958
[Cole] Oof!

330
00:13:58,958 --> 00:14:00,333
[Riyu growls]

331
00:14:00,333 --> 00:14:01,666
[Kai and Jay] Yaah!

332
00:14:04,250 --> 00:14:05,500
[Beatrix] No!

333
00:14:05,500 --> 00:14:09,458
You will not rob me
of my divine status again!

334
00:14:09,458 --> 00:14:10,416
[blow landing]

335
00:14:10,416 --> 00:14:12,041
[Lloyd] I warned you

336
00:14:12,041 --> 00:14:14,833
not to underestimate
my new powers.

337
00:14:17,250 --> 00:14:18,291
Yaah!

338
00:14:19,541 --> 00:14:21,208
[gasping]

339
00:14:23,208 --> 00:14:24,791
[Cole] No! Don't touch that!

340
00:14:24,791 --> 00:14:26,833
It makes Elemental Powers
go haywire!

341
00:14:29,416 --> 00:14:31,291
[Arin]
Then I guess it's up to me.

342
00:14:31,291 --> 00:14:32,708
[monsters growling]

343
00:14:33,500 --> 00:14:34,958
[screaming] No!

344
00:14:34,958 --> 00:14:35,958
Give that back!

345
00:14:35,958 --> 00:14:38,041
[growling]

346
00:14:38,041 --> 00:14:39,375
[Beatrix]
Only I deserve to--

347
00:14:39,375 --> 00:14:40,375
[blow landing]

348
00:14:41,041 --> 00:14:42,666
[grunting]

349
00:14:42,666 --> 00:14:44,291
[growling]

350
00:14:44,291 --> 00:14:46,833
You repulsive beast,

351
00:14:46,833 --> 00:14:47,750
you are no match--

352
00:14:47,750 --> 00:14:49,375
[yelping]

353
00:14:49,375 --> 00:14:50,291
Aah!

354
00:14:51,791 --> 00:14:54,166
So, how do I shut
this terrifying thing down?

355
00:14:54,875 --> 00:14:56,083
[rock crumbling]

356
00:14:56,083 --> 00:14:59,083
[Cole grunts]

357
00:14:59,083 --> 00:15:00,708
Dr. LaRow, she activated it

358
00:15:00,708 --> 00:15:03,250
by saying
some enchantment backwards.

359
00:15:03,250 --> 00:15:05,333
Okay, how does that
help us now?

360
00:15:05,333 --> 00:15:07,041
There was one final word,

361
00:15:07,041 --> 00:15:08,375
but we have to say it forward.

362
00:15:08,375 --> 00:15:10,291
Uh... Tungo-Ham!

363
00:15:10,291 --> 00:15:12,333
Tungo-Ham!

364
00:15:13,875 --> 00:15:14,833
[Arin] Not it!

365
00:15:14,833 --> 00:15:17,875
No? Um, try Tanji... blab!

366
00:15:17,875 --> 00:15:19,041
No... blub!

367
00:15:19,041 --> 00:15:20,583
[Arin] Are you just
making up words now?

368
00:15:20,583 --> 00:15:23,291
Ba vang naut...

369
00:15:23,291 --> 00:15:25,500
Tan... gauv... Hab?

370
00:15:25,500 --> 00:15:26,500
That's gotta be it!

371
00:15:26,500 --> 00:15:27,791
Tangauv-Hab!

372
00:15:27,791 --> 00:15:30,375
Oh, please be right,
please be right...

373
00:15:30,375 --> 00:15:32,041
Tangauv-Hab!

374
00:15:32,041 --> 00:15:33,125
[blasting]

375
00:15:34,833 --> 00:15:35,958
[straining]

376
00:15:37,166 --> 00:15:40,208
[Sora] Grab onto something!

377
00:15:40,208 --> 00:15:42,500
[♪♪♪]

378
00:15:53,208 --> 00:15:54,458
[Arin gasps]

379
00:16:04,500 --> 00:16:06,583
You did it! [laughing]

380
00:16:06,583 --> 00:16:08,166
Never a dull moment

381
00:16:08,166 --> 00:16:09,791
in visiting your hometown,
is there?

382
00:16:09,791 --> 00:16:10,958
[chuckling] Yeah,

383
00:16:10,958 --> 00:16:11,958
we gotta stop visiting.

384
00:16:11,958 --> 00:16:14,541
[both chuckling]

385
00:16:16,250 --> 00:16:18,083
[♪♪♪]

386
00:16:20,708 --> 00:16:22,833
[Arc Dragon gasping]

387
00:16:25,500 --> 00:16:27,750
[roaring]

388
00:16:27,750 --> 00:16:30,541
[♪♪♪]

389
00:16:32,750 --> 00:16:35,375
[swirling whispers growing]

390
00:16:35,375 --> 00:16:37,208
[♪♪♪]

391
00:16:37,208 --> 00:16:42,666
<i>The Legendary Green Ninja</i>
<i>has succeeded.</i>

392
00:16:45,750 --> 00:16:47,583
[Wyldfyre] Unconscious?!

393
00:16:47,583 --> 00:16:49,625
Aw... I guess it's not cool

394
00:16:49,625 --> 00:16:51,416
to blast someone with fireballs

395
00:16:51,416 --> 00:16:53,208
if they're unconscious...

396
00:16:53,208 --> 00:16:55,000
[quietly] ...but we both know
you deserve it.

397
00:16:55,000 --> 00:16:57,750
Arin, that was...
that was amazing.

398
00:16:57,750 --> 00:17:00,083
I just held this thing.

399
00:17:00,083 --> 00:17:01,291
It wasn't awesome

400
00:17:01,291 --> 00:17:03,291
like becoming
freaking dragon people!

401
00:17:05,083 --> 00:17:08,416
So, uh, any... explanation?

402
00:17:08,416 --> 00:17:10,166
[Lloyd] Long story,

403
00:17:10,166 --> 00:17:12,916
but let's just say
I finally know

404
00:17:12,916 --> 00:17:15,208
what the True Potential
of the Green Ninja is.

405
00:17:15,208 --> 00:17:17,250
To turn other Ninja
into dragons

406
00:17:17,250 --> 00:17:18,750
but not me?

407
00:17:18,750 --> 00:17:20,416
Hmph! Great. Just great.

408
00:17:20,416 --> 00:17:23,666
[Lloyd] No,
it's to connect with others,

409
00:17:23,666 --> 00:17:25,875
to unite
and understand the world

410
00:17:25,875 --> 00:17:27,125
through their perspectives

411
00:17:27,125 --> 00:17:28,916
and enhance their powers.

412
00:17:28,916 --> 00:17:31,416
[Nya] That's why our powers
started working again

413
00:17:31,416 --> 00:17:33,375
and you could turn us
into dragons?

414
00:17:33,375 --> 00:17:34,583
[Lloyd] I...

415
00:17:34,583 --> 00:17:36,500
I didn't expect
that part to happen,

416
00:17:36,500 --> 00:17:38,000
but uniting with others

417
00:17:38,000 --> 00:17:40,416
shares a part of ourselves
with them.

418
00:17:40,416 --> 00:17:43,500
It's something
our enemies rarely do,

419
00:17:43,500 --> 00:17:45,875
and it's clearly stronger
than I ever imagined.

420
00:17:45,875 --> 00:17:47,625
[shots blasting]

421
00:17:47,625 --> 00:17:49,375
We'd better
shut down the strays.

422
00:17:51,041 --> 00:17:52,083
[Jay] Cole!

423
00:17:52,083 --> 00:17:53,458
I haven't seen you
fight that awesome

424
00:17:53,458 --> 00:17:54,791
since Shintaro.

425
00:17:54,791 --> 00:17:56,208
Thanks! I di--

426
00:17:56,208 --> 00:17:57,708
Wait, you have
your memories back?

427
00:17:57,708 --> 00:17:58,958
[Jay] A bunch of 'em.

428
00:17:58,958 --> 00:18:01,625
I can't believe you made a crack
in the monastery wall

429
00:18:01,625 --> 00:18:02,750
that looked like noodles!

430
00:18:02,750 --> 00:18:04,833
What? We both did that!

431
00:18:04,833 --> 00:18:06,250
[Jay] Not how I choose
to remember it!

432
00:18:06,250 --> 00:18:09,083
[♪♪♪]

433
00:18:13,333 --> 00:18:14,416
Unh!

434
00:18:16,041 --> 00:18:17,000
[Loyalist groaning]

435
00:18:17,000 --> 00:18:17,958
[crowd cheering]

436
00:18:18,958 --> 00:18:20,250
Wha-ho!

437
00:18:20,250 --> 00:18:22,291
[cheering]

438
00:18:22,291 --> 00:18:24,791
[Imperian] Percival,
we apprehended two more!

439
00:18:24,791 --> 00:18:27,333
We have to find them all!

440
00:18:27,333 --> 00:18:29,500
[♪♪♪]

441
00:18:41,458 --> 00:18:43,750
[medical monitors beeping]

442
00:18:44,500 --> 00:18:47,208
[breath wheezing]

443
00:18:47,208 --> 00:18:49,875
[♪♪♪]

444
00:18:49,875 --> 00:18:51,833
[Lloyd] It clearly has ties

445
00:18:51,833 --> 00:18:53,958
to the very creation
of our world,

446
00:18:53,958 --> 00:18:55,166
but we never heard of it.

447
00:18:55,166 --> 00:18:57,458
How did Beatrix find
the Weapon of Desolation?

448
00:18:57,458 --> 00:18:59,000
Beatrix?

449
00:18:59,000 --> 00:19:00,625
It was all me!

450
00:19:00,625 --> 00:19:02,916
She of course
would take the credit.

451
00:19:02,916 --> 00:19:04,666
Yet you supported her.

452
00:19:04,666 --> 00:19:06,208
So many of you did.

453
00:19:06,208 --> 00:19:08,750
I can't for the life of me
make sense of that.

454
00:19:08,750 --> 00:19:11,750
I'm well aware
of how unstable Beatrix can be,

455
00:19:11,750 --> 00:19:15,333
but when she fell,
when Imperium fell,

456
00:19:15,333 --> 00:19:16,750
I had nothing.

457
00:19:16,750 --> 00:19:18,500
I was certain
if I helped her return,

458
00:19:18,500 --> 00:19:20,958
I could keep her worst impulses
under control.

459
00:19:20,958 --> 00:19:23,333
But Beatrix can't be controlled.

460
00:19:23,333 --> 00:19:25,583
I-I'm not sure that's true.

461
00:19:25,583 --> 00:19:27,791
I could not control her,

462
00:19:27,791 --> 00:19:29,666
but I think...

463
00:19:29,666 --> 00:19:31,291
I think somehow, in the end,

464
00:19:31,291 --> 00:19:34,916
the Weapon was controlling her.

465
00:19:38,041 --> 00:19:39,041
Where'd you learn
about this thing?

466
00:19:39,041 --> 00:19:42,208
In a place
I could never find again.

467
00:19:42,208 --> 00:19:44,708
I don't believe
it even has a name.

468
00:19:49,708 --> 00:19:51,375
<i>[telepathically]</i>
<i>Yes, I agree.</i>

469
00:19:51,375 --> 00:19:54,000
<i>I see now,</i>
<i>with the realms combined,</i>

470
00:19:54,000 --> 00:19:56,666
<i>your duty is not only to us,</i>

471
00:19:56,666 --> 00:19:59,500
<i>but to the entire Merged Lands.</i>

472
00:19:59,500 --> 00:20:02,375
<i>The role</i>
<i>of the Legendary Green Ninja</i>

473
00:20:02,375 --> 00:20:03,833
<i>has evolved.</i>

474
00:20:03,833 --> 00:20:06,125
And I will live up
to this new mantle,

475
00:20:06,125 --> 00:20:07,500
I promise.

476
00:20:13,625 --> 00:20:16,250
Very impressive, Riyu.

477
00:20:16,250 --> 00:20:17,583
[Riyu grunts]

478
00:20:18,750 --> 00:20:21,000
[♪♪♪]

479
00:20:21,000 --> 00:20:22,541
[laughter]

480
00:20:24,666 --> 00:20:27,375
[♪♪♪]

481
00:20:30,000 --> 00:20:31,291
[smashing inside]

482
00:20:31,291 --> 00:20:32,541
[Cole] No, it's my turn!

483
00:20:33,666 --> 00:20:35,291
Y'ah!

484
00:20:35,291 --> 00:20:36,750
-H'yah!
-[Jay] It's not your turn!

485
00:20:36,750 --> 00:20:38,125
[Cole] You've been
playing for hours!

486
00:20:38,125 --> 00:20:39,083
[Jay] It's not my fault

487
00:20:39,083 --> 00:20:40,583
I'm better at this game
than you!

488
00:20:40,583 --> 00:20:42,041
[giggling]

489
00:20:42,041 --> 00:20:42,958
[struggling]

490
00:20:42,958 --> 00:20:43,875
[Jay] Huh?

491
00:20:48,041 --> 00:20:49,500
[can clattering]

492
00:20:54,791 --> 00:20:58,208
Yeah, his dad was leading
the Explorers Club expedition.

493
00:20:58,208 --> 00:21:00,083
Let me just say, again,

494
00:21:00,083 --> 00:21:02,833
you should be so happy
your parents are amazing.

495
00:21:02,833 --> 00:21:04,041
[Arin chuckles]

496
00:21:04,041 --> 00:21:05,291
[knocking on monastery door]

497
00:21:06,500 --> 00:21:10,291
Welcome
to the Monastery of Spinjitzu.

498
00:21:10,291 --> 00:21:11,875
And who might you be?

499
00:21:12,625 --> 00:21:13,625
Mom?

500
00:21:14,541 --> 00:21:15,541
Dad?

501
00:21:15,541 --> 00:21:18,291
[♪♪♪]

502
00:21:22,500 --> 00:21:23,375
[growling]

503
00:21:35,000 --> 00:21:37,333
Master!

504
00:21:37,333 --> 00:21:41,958
I have collected another icon!

505
00:21:41,958 --> 00:21:44,958
[roaring]

506
00:21:46,833 --> 00:21:48,666
[♪♪♪]

